  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_spurge_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>spurge, one or another of several species of plants belonging to the extensive genus Euphorbia, many of which are characterized by an acrid milky juice possessing purgative or medicinal properties (OED s.v. spurge n.1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
